---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — rakyzu">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-24 text-fg-sec text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-fg">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-fg-muted text-xs">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-fg mt-8 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you use the contact form or guestbook, we collect your name, email address, and message. This information is stored securely in our database and used only to respond to your inquiries.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-fg mt-8 mb-3">2. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use minimal cookies for essential functionality: theme preference (light/dark mode) and language selection. Cloudflare Web Analytics may use a cookie to track page views anonymously. No personal data is sold or shared with third parties.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-fg mt-8 mb-3">3. Cloudflare Services</h2>
      <p>This site is served through Cloudflare's network. Cloudflare may set essential security cookies to protect against malicious traffic. For more information, see <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-fg">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-fg mt-8 mb-3">4. Data Storage</h2>
      <p>Messages submitted via the contact form and guestbook are stored in Cloudflare D1 (serverless database). Your data is retained indefinitely so we can reference past communications. You may request deletion at any time by contacting us.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-fg mt-8 mb-3">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use Cloudflare Turnstile for bot protection and Google Fonts for typography. These services may collect anonymized data as described in their respective privacy policies.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-fg mt-8 mb-3">6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. To exercise these rights, please contact us at zulhampratama@rakyzu.my.id.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-fg mt-8 mb-3">7. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about this privacy policy, reach out at zulhampratama@rakyzu.my.id.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="pt-8">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm underline hover:text-fg">&larr; Back to home</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
